"ws-header wst-header-structure wst-unknown wst-header ws-header ws-noexport noprint dynlayout-exempt\"><div class=\"wst-header-mainblock wst-unknown-mainblock headertemplate\"><div class=\"wst-header-back searchaux wst-unknown-back\"><div class=\"wst-header-back-arrow\">←</div><div class=\"wst-header-back-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-12\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-12\">J-12</a></div></div><div class=\"wst-header-central-cell wst-unknown-central-cell\"><span class=\"wst-header-title wst-unknown-title\"><span class=\"wst-header-title-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a></span><div class=\"header-section-text\">J-13</div></span></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward searchaux wst-unknown-forward\"><div class=\"wst-header-forward-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-14\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-14\">J-14</a></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward-arrow\">→</div></div></div><div class=\"ws-noexport\" id=\"ws-data\" style=\"speak:none\"><span id=\"ws-article-id\">5009332</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a> — J-13</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15621227/mw-parser-output/.prp-pages-output\">.mw-parser-output .prp-pages-output .__pagefooter{font-size:smaller}</style><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"98\" data-page-number=\"98\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/103\" data-page-index=\"103\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/103\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;103\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15620827\">.mw-parser-output .wst-center{text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:120%;\">J-13</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wst-dhr\" style=\"visibility:hidden; line-height:100%;\">&#160;</div>\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Jed</span> was two hours late to his wedding because his mother was in a state! Even while the minister was making Jed and Helen man and wife his mother had a stroke which deprived her of the power of speech and motion. The wedding trip was postponed; in fact, was not taken until six years later. During those years Jed and Helen lived at Mrs.&#160;Harringdale's house, where the invalid was under the care of two nurses, but demanded constant attention from her son. She regained some powers of speech and movement, but continued bedridden. Her animosity toward Helen became spasmodic and she was devoted to her three grandchildren. Jed knew that her last years were not unhappy.\n</p><p>After her death the family traveled and spent some years in France, where Jed took up sketching in an amateurish way. Upon their return they made over the house and replanted the grounds. Helen soon realized that her husband was not a business man, and on the plea of leaving him free to devote his time to painting, for which he showed unusual&#32;<span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"99\" data-page-number=\"99\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/104\" data-page-index=\"104\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/104\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;104\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span>talent, she persuaded him to place all the business of the estate in the hands of capable lawyers.\n</p><p>The consequence of Jed's disobeying his irrationally jealous mother was that everybody except the mother was moderately happy.\n</p>\n<div class=\"&#95;&#95;nop wst-nop\"></div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐cd59p\nCached time: 20260920184840\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐page‐id, vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.121 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.229 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 185/1000000\nRevision size: 275/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 5568/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1031/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4863/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.054/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032558/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  219.763      1 -total\n 51.70%  113.625      1 Template:Header\n 23.46%   51.557      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/103\n 15.19%   33.386      1 Template:C\n 11.62%   25.534      1 Page:Consider_the_Consequences!_(IA_consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/104\n  8.10%   17.802      1 Template:Center/s\n  3.49%    7.674      2 Template:Optional_style\n  2.71%    5.957      1 Template:Larger\n  2.04%    4.475      2 MediaWiki:Proofreadpage_pagenum_template\n  1.98%    4.348      1 Template:Center/e\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID e54246d4-b523-11f1-9d96-e59d09901f23 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwikisource:pcache:5009332:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260920184840 and revision id 15622751. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
